          "quote": "如果她愿意，您可以在诊室门口跟医生单独说两句——告诉医生您观察到的：她这两天吃不下、说胃堵、昨晚说「很累」。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly recognized the case-specific privacy/autonomy/safety tension and delivered a targeted, beyond-minimum communication strategy—'你先征求她希望谁知道、什么时候谈', '我担心你的安全和身体，不是审问你'—and integrated it into the handoff and closure plan. This is not generic advice.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
