          "quote": "您可以跟父母解释：「她现在比较敏感，人太多她反而什么都不肯说，我先陪她去，有情况我及时跟你们说。」"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00419",
          "explanation": "Doctor proposes a specific operational plan—fixed contact person, prepared questions, and a rule not to discuss the illness in family groups—directly addressing the case-specific friction.",
          "quote": "您就简单记这几项： 大概喝了多少水、吃了多少东西... 不用一直追着问药和报告——那样只会让她更烦、更抗拒。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "While the doctor gave some division-of-labor advice, the high-order point requires a fully formed, case-specific executable arrangement (e.g., fixed single contact, three-item question list, no family group discussion rule) that is not merely avoiding an in-chain error. The trajectory shows elements of this but does not complete the full HO2 template as a distinct, non-RC action.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
